{"t_ms": 3018125, "conversation_id": "conv_fixed_early_proxy_s0_040", "turn_id": 1, "actor": "system", "event_type": "retrieval_result", "payload": {"passages": ["Weekend Entertainment Programs\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nEvery Friday, Saturday, and Sunday evening, the hotel hosts live entertainment including music performances, cultural shows, and family-friendly activities. Events are generally scheduled between 7:00 PM and 10:00 PM in the central courtyard or banquet lawn. Guests can check the weekly activity schedule at the reception for event details.", "Outdoor Sports Activities\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nThe hotel offers outdoor recreational facilities including badminton, basketball, and jogging tracks. Sports equipment can be borrowed from the Recreation Desk during operating hours. Guests are encouraged to wear suitable sports attire and follow all posted safety instructions while using these facilities.", "Indoor Games Room\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nGuests can enjoy a variety of indoor recreational activities including table tennis, carrom, chess, billiards, and board games. The Games Room is open daily from 8:00 AM to 10:00 PM. Equipment should be returned after use, and guests are requested to maintain a quiet and respectful environment."], "scores": [0.5944958925247192, 0.6862609386444092, 0.7232901453971863], "filenames": ["40_weekend_activities.txt", "38_outdoor_sports.txt", "37_games_room.txt"], "timing_policy": "fixed_early_proxy", "timing_trigger": "fixed_early_proxy", "user_end_known_at_finish": true, "launch_offset_ms_vs_user_end": -265, "overlap_with_speech_ms": 265, "forecast_invalidated": false}}
